	(text
		"CRL-TRK-2W-L1  Two-wheeler tracker LITE  -  60 x 45 mm, 2-layer 1.6 mm FR-4, single-sided SMT\n\nVEHICLE 9-30 V -> F1 / D1 TVS -> D2 reverse diode -> XL1509 buck 4.44 V -+-> D4 -> VSYS 3.3-4.3 V -> EC200U VBAT\n                                                                       +-> MCP73831 -> 300 mAh LiPo -> Q1 P-FET -> VSYS\n\nEC200U-CN (Cat-1 bis + GSM, runs the firmware) -> U.FL -> FPC LTE/GSM antenna\n      <-MAIN UART (BSS138 1.8/3.3 V)-> L76K GPS/BDS/GLONASS -> U.FL -> active L1 patch\n      <-I2C-> LIS3DH   <-GPIO-> IGN sense, relay driver, GNSS_EN   <-ADC-> VIN/30, VBAT/4\n\nParked (ignition off): modem sleep + GNSS off + LIS3DH wake-on-motion, ~2-3 mA from the vehicle battery."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
